            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.21.2+EXO.21.3+EXO.21.4+EXO.21.5+EXO.21.6"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ena 21.2-6",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.15.12+DEU.15.13+DEU.15.14+DEU.15.15+DEU.15.16+DEU.15.17+DEU.15.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Enkig 15.12-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " “Naa teneaku olalashe lino aisinani te mbata iyie, nikimiraki iyie kewan enye, mincho iyie ninye mikisiaayia anaa orrindik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keaku ninye tenebo iyie olaisiaayiani lolmushaara o anaa sii olomoni. Eikisiaai ninye iyie ometabau olari le Yubilii; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nikitum taa ashomo atung'uai, ninye o nkera enyena naatii tenebo ninye, neshuko alo enetii olmarei lenye, neshuko alo enetii imasaa o loo menye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu isinkan lainei ninche, apa layaua nanu aitupuku te nkop e Misiri; mepuoi aamir ninche anaa rrindiki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Milo iyie aitore ninye te nkisikong'ata kake turia Enkai ino. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore tialo ilewa aashu ing'oruo rrindiki linono ooba anaa iliaata indim iyie ainyiang'u ilewa aashu ing'oruo rrindiki tiatua lelo oshon likimanita iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Indim sii te lelo omon likindurrakita iyie o te lelo mareita lenye ootii tenebo iyie, te lelo ootoiwuoki tiatua enkop ino; neaku ninche imasaa inono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninguekiki ilayiok linyi te siadi intae, pee ejung aaitaa imasaa enye intarasi; ndimidimi intae aaitaa ninche irrindiki, kake ore te shumata ilalashera linyi lelo tung'ana le Israel mintorere, oltung'ani ake olikae tenkisikong'ata.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.46"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Tenelo neaku olomoni aashu ilo oidurrua karsis, ore olalashe lino otashare neaku aisinani nemiraki kewan ilo omoni aashu ilo oidurrua otii tenebo iyie, aashu obo lo lmarei leilo tung'ani omoni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ore eidipaki aatimir ninye neidimi aatokordu ninye; keidim obo loo lalashera lenyena atalaku ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aashu olenkapu lenye aashu enkerai olenkapu lenye, neidim atalaku ninye, aashu oltung'ani le sotua onyikare oleng ora ololmarei lenye neidim atalaku ninye; aashu tenekarsisu neidim atalaku kewan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Neiken ninye tenebo ilo apa oyawua ninye ebaiki ilo ari apa otimirakinye kewan ninye ometabau olari le Yubilii, ore enkinyang'a e lakunoto enye neaku te risioroto oo larin. Ore apa enkata natii ninye tenebo ilo ora olopeny neikenari anaa enkata olaisiaayiani lolmushaara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa teneton etii ilarin kumok, ore te risioroto enye nerriny alak ninche teina kinyang'a apa natalaaki te nkaraki ninye, enkinyang'a e lakunoto enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
