              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa teneng'or ilkuti arin pee ebau olari le Yubilii, neikenakino ninche, ore te risioroto oo larin le nkisiayiare oong'or te ninye nelak ninye mpisai te nkaraki elakunoto enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ore anaa osinka lo lmushaara to lari ake o to lari neijia ninye etiu tenebo ilo; nemeitore ninye ninye te nkisikong'ata te dukuya iyie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naa teneitu elakuni ninye te kuna oitoi; nepuoi naa aalaaya ninye to lari le Yubilii, ninye o nkera enyena naatii tenebo ninye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.25.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.25.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
