            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 25:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amu ore te nanu iltung'ana le Israel naa isinkan, isinkan laainei ninche layaua nanu aitupuku te nkop e Misiri: Ara nanu Olaitoriani Enkai ino.",
          "type": "text",
